        "# Aws Fundamentals - mod-10\n\n",
        "**Course:** aws-fundamentals\n\n",
        "Run the code cells below to practice.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# A Record \u2014 domain to IPv4\naws route53 change-resource-record-sets --hosted-zone-id Z123 --change-batch '{\n  \"Changes\": [{\"Action\": \"UPSERT\", \"ResourceRecordSet\": {\n    \"Name\": \"api.example.com\", \"Type\": \"A\", \"TTL\": 300,\n    \"ResourceRecords\": [{\"Value\": \"54.23.10.5\"}]\n  }}]\n}'\n\n# CNAME \u2014 domain to another domain\n# \"blog.example.com\" \u2192 \"myblog.wordpress.com\"\n\n# Alias \u2014 domain to AWS resource (free, instant, supports zone apex)\n# \"example.com\" \u2192 CloudFront distribution / ALB / S3 website"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# Simple: single resource\n# Weighted: split traffic (A/B testing)\n#   90% \u2192 server-a, 10% \u2192 server-b\n\n# Latency-based: route to nearest region\n# Failover: primary/secondary with health check\n# Geolocation: route by user's country/continent"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "aws route53 create-health-check --caller-reference \"api-check-$(date +%s)\" \\\n  --health-check-config '{\n    \"IPAddress\": \"54.23.10.5\",\n    \"Port\": 443,\n    \"Type\": \"HTTPS\",\n    \"ResourcePath\": \"/health\",\n    \"RequestInterval\": 30,\n    \"FailureThreshold\": 3\n  }'"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "import boto3\n\nroute53 = boto3.client('route53')\n\n# Create failover records: primary (us-east-1) + secondary (eu-west-1)\nroute53.change_resource_record_sets(\n    HostedZoneId='Z123',\n    ChangeBatch={'Changes': [\n        {'Action': 'UPSERT', 'ResourceRecordSet': {\n            'Name': 'api.example.com', 'Type': 'A',\n            'SetIdentifier': 'primary',\n            'Failover': 'PRIMARY',\n            'HealthCheckId': 'health-check-id-us',\n            'AliasTarget': {\n                'HostedZoneId': 'Z35SXDOTRQ7X7K',\n                'DNSName': 'alb-us-east.amazonaws.com',\n                'EvaluateTargetHealth': True\n            }\n        }},\n        {'Action': 'UPSERT', 'ResourceRecordSet': {\n            'Name': 'api.example.com', 'Type': 'A',\n            'SetIdentifier': 'secondary',\n            'Failover': 'SECONDARY',\n            'AliasTarget': {\n                'HostedZoneId': 'Z32O12XQLNTSW2',\n                'DNSName': 'alb-eu-west.amazonaws.com',\n                'EvaluateTargetHealth': True\n            }\n        }}\n    ]}\n)"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
